error[B0221]: this `input` has no label
  --> t.beck:108:13
    |
108 |             input(class=["w-full", "p-2", "border", "rounded"],
    |             ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^ a placeholder is not a label — it disappears as soon as somebody types
    |
  = note: `id=` is accepted as evidence of a `label(for=…)` elsewhere, because a `ui:` block composes out of functions and this check sees one at a time
  = help: add `aria_label="…"`, an `id=` with a `label(for=…)`, or `a11y_exempt="…"` with a reason
